{"server":"tw","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_09_beg","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_09","title":"長壽麵","storyCode":"OR-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3a1428782addad0fcf95bf3b82d56e6b3d52a4d10a44aac3ca38d84bbc976241","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"歲獸一事終於還是到了最後的關頭。玉門城樓上，梁洵面對太傅坦白了自己在事件中的行動。在城外古寺，兩位許久不見的代理人重新聚首。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_ex1_snowmount"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"男人脫下官服，仔細摺疊整齊，和隨身帶的書籍放在一處，向東邊的方向再三拜首。\n他走出了營地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的火的確變得更燙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，你的源石技藝對自己身體的消耗很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開始怕熱了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，這不過是我一個人的血……我清楚，我之所以還能站在這裡，是因為已經有太多人流過血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你已經知道了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算不上很多，但最重要的是，我只要知道一件事就夠了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些被掩蓋掉姓名的人，那些死得不明不白的人……都不能就這樣算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，我從來沒有想過自己的身世還會牽扯出這麼複雜的故事，也沒有想過自己還有為感染者而戰之外的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我想明白了，道理是一樣的。我的血，是為制止我看到的一切不公義的事情而流的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以血引火……感染者，你倒有幾分古時義士之風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在你一葉障目，最好不要輕易談什麼公正。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，我受命要將你帶回，斷不可再放走你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我知道……我見過你這種人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許不能簡單地說你們是壞人，你們只是被訓練成這副無血無淚的樣子……所以別人的血和淚，你們也不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有關係，我不會和你講什麼道理——你大可以試著攔住我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖是賊寇亂黨……勇氣可嘉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心點，我會留你一命，但未必能保你四肢健全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"縱貫白雷正法，破！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你有很多話想說，但是當務之急只有一件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是要去見真龍嗎，我來幫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯？你應該在獄中！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我現在站在你面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手下敗將，你輸給過我一次。這一次，你們兩個，都別想走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我也沒有打算和你單挑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說是我提議要來的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可招惹到的這個對手……不好對付啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有同夥……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你將她從大獄中帶出來的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用了點粗暴手段，但盡可能避免傷及無辜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"債多了不愁，我有那麼多罪責難逃，也不差這一樁。等這邊事了，我投案服法便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是當下，該辦的事，該見的人，都需要一個結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肅政院御史，大理寺少卿，協同犯上作亂……我從未見過如此荒唐的場面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然已經足夠荒唐，那便再算我一個吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小教頭，別來無恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合？！你不是在玉門受了重傷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是……傷得有點重了。身上這點功夫，還有沒有原來三成都不好說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以今天，還是希望盡可能不要動手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，連你也要參與進來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿來得突然，我還來不及瞭解事情全貌。但二位都是我最敬佩的同僚，我也只能以故友身分，勸二位留一絲和談的餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們執意要做這般大逆不道之事，還期待我視若不見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“取忠捨義”……但誰說，這二者只能選其一呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公義……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要逗留，快進去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是，禁城撤防的訊號……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下……難道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從這裡看過去，都已經能看到禁城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次站在這城樓上的時候，還是春天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這半年著實發生了不少事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天氣已經涼了，城頭風大。太傅注意身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朝堂諸公，想來是沒有幾個人從這個角度看過百灶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"登高望遠，也總有浮雲遮目，不見得總能看得清的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……行事當思進退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，我當初讓你來擔任玉門參知是何意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"私以為，是太傅想讓在下開拓眼界，見識大局。是給在下的機會，也是考驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於何事的考驗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是否堪當大用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你知道，今天我叫你來是何意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是太傅，對在下失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是推脫堂皇之詞，還是當真作此想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下清楚，先前百珍宴之舉，是下下之策。可是也別無他法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……迫使百珍宴中斷，不給太尉先斬後奏、倒逼真龍的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從你捲入這一系列紛爭中，三次陷入抉擇，而每次都是行最險的棋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你將你的朋友，連帶你自己，一同放在這棋盤上……你就從來沒有猶豫過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下不敢說毫無私情……可再三權衡，唯有顧全大局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……算得上能謀，但不可謂善斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本想挑選一位有抱負而無貪欲，有手腕而無私心的年輕才幹，多給些歷練的機會。如有可能，便可以大事相託。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本以為，你是一個適合的人選……可執棋者以身作子，大多是不得善終的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讓我想起一位同僚……已經是位故去之人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下慚愧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……梁洵，如果再給你一次機會選擇，你可還願意離開尚蜀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下在求學之初，立志要讓畢生所學為天下人所用。至於身居何位，不過是機遇使然……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下初心不曾變過，也不會為做過的選擇後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百珍宴的意外，需要一個說法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下甘願服法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天鏡閣的藏書樓缺一位謄錄郎，明天起你就去那裡任職吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……多謝太傅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……終於是要到了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雲積得很厚，遮住了圓月清光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅曾見過那個人……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不曾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這局棋上，他求的對手，究竟是誰呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時棋局上，所求的並非與對手的輸贏，而是一個解法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……在無數變化中，尋求一個雙方都可接受的兩全之解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下想要請教太傅……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您當初，是為何決定，要設下那一場大考？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"店家，還沒打烊吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕得真巧，做完你這單生意就打烊了。不過時候確實晚了，店裡剩的吃的也不多了。要點什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不挑，隨便買點能路上充飢的就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那正好這裡還剩半籠肉包子，早上做的，也不要錢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼做生意，那不就成了虧本買賣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我本來就只會做飯，不太會做生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼好的手藝，就不想靠它掙些名利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼用呢？王侯貴胄、販夫走卒，誰不都還是吃一日三餐。掙什麼名利，還不如蒸包子有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多嘴一問，平時百姓來這裡吃一餐飯要多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不貴不貴，最平常的兩菜一湯，幾塊錢就能打發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是能在百灶有份活計，就能在這家飯館裡吃飽飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來店家竟然有顆濟世仁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別別，您可別這麼說我……我就只是一介廚師，每天能招待的客人，撐死也不過百來號人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要想讓全天下人都衣食無憂，那只能靠您多費心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白吃你一頓包子，還能聽到一個教訓……不虧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我平時就喜歡和客人聊天，東拉西扯的，說話也沒有分寸，您別生我的氣就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒記錯的話，這家店開了也蠻長一段時間了，盈虧如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……這可就頭痛了。您看，我這小店一年到頭，也就勉強回本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是今年大荒城糧產缺了些，或者馳道不通，貨物運輸慢了些，我這小飯館成本高了，這裡的人也就吃不到這個價格的飯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這是在替其他幾位邀功？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……可是帳還沒算完呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來這吃飯的都是街坊鄰居，有人吃完飯賒了一點飯錢，要嘛送我幾大箱新鮮水果，要嘛負責了屋裡的傢俱維修……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是沒了他們關照，這家小飯館還是開不下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，這筆帳實在不好算啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做生意不就是這樣，誰說一定要你死我活呢？有來有往，和氣生財，生意才能做得長久嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅大人，半籠包子，幫您裝好了。您要不要先嚐嚐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……味道是不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別學那個做生意的說話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大人，您買完飯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，聽說這家包子的味道是百灶一絕，分你一個嚐嚐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……嗯……好吃，真好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行，吃點東西也有勁趕路了。我們去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……尚蜀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
